                "description": "Baldwin DUN-HFR Dunsmoor Leverset with Chamfered Roses - The Dunsmoor Lever with Chamfered Rose is a very sophisticated looking leverset. The combination of the sleek  classic lever paired with the more traditional design of the chamfered rose makes it a popular choice for designers everywhere. The Baldwin Reserve Dunsmoor Lever is easy to install and available in 6 color choices.",
